### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Create document
POST http://localhost:8000/documents
X-Tenant-ID: tenant-a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Distributed Search Architecture",
  "content": "Elasticsearch and Redis support fast distributed document search.",
  "metadata": {
    "category": "architecture",
    "tags": ["search", "distributed-systems"]
  }
}

### Search documents
GET http://localhost:8000/search?q=distributed%20search&page=1&page_size=20
X-Tenant-ID: tenant-a

### Get document
GET http://localhost:8000/documents/{{document_id}}
X-Tenant-ID: tenant-a

### Delete document
DELETE http://localhost:8000/documents/{{document_id}}
X-Tenant-ID: tenant-a
